WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
Kazune-kun? And the Festival

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:49.080
Kazune-chan…

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:55.130
Kazune-kun's been sleeping ever since then.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.110
Somehow…

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.410
it's different than usual…

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:03.590
Kazune-kun, I'll protect you…

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.400
Is something wrong?

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:28.440
I… even though I have the power of a god…

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:33.020
not being able to do anything to save Kazune-kun is frustrating!

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:37.750
That Kazune-sama is still alive is all thanks to you.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.210
Kyuu-chan…

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:43.450
That time in the freezing cold…

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:46.290
if you hadn't warmed him up…

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.350
he would have been in real danger.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:54.640
Trust Kazune-sama, and wait patiently for him.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.350
Don't push yourself too much.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:09.560
I'm worried about you too, Himeka-chan.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:13.190
No, I'm fine.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:19.000
You know, ever since the other day I've felt much better.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.010
Are you alright, Himeka?

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:27.510
This is all because Kujyou broke my ring!

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.920
Nishikiyori's power…

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.640
is it starting to awaken?

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.150
Looks like the festival's today.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:59.440
I go with Kazune-chan every year…

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:06.800
but, this year Kazune-chan is still sleeping…

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:11.450
even after he slept for more than a week…

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.750
Himeka-chan…

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:27.550
Please, God!

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:31.060
No, even if it's not God, anyone is fine.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:32.140
Somehow…

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.440
Somehow, please save Kazune-kun!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.790
I beg you!

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.020
Karin.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.240
Kazune-kun!

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:13.930
Karin.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.560
You woke up!

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:18.310
Thank goodness!

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.040
Really, thank goodness!

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.650
Ah! Suzune-kun!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.050
Why is Suzune-kun here?

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:29.870
I need to talk to you.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:30.840
Huh?

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:50.010
Let's go, Karin.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.990
You're kidding, right?

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.780
We're too high up!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.620
I see, today's the festival.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.910
Yeah, it's so nostalgic.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.470
Yay! That looks like fun!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.670
Hey, hey, Papa! I want that!

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.050
P-P-Papa?!

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:27.880
D-Don't worry about it!

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.150
He's just making a mistake!

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.660
Thank you, Papa!

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:40.690
That's right, last time he mistook me for his Mama…

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:45.280
But, I didn't know Suzune-kun and Kazune-kun knew each other.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.440
I want to eat some cotton candy!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.950
Ah, me too!

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.420
I got it…

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.330
And next I want fried corn!

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:56.090
You haven't changed at all, have you.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:14.180
After I'm done eating this…

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.810
I'll have candy apples, takoyaki…

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.640
You still want to eat more?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.400
Of course!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.980
Since you've become better,…

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:26.040
you definitely have to get mad at me at least once!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:32.880
I'll have crepes, okonomiyaki, frankfurters.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.450
I have to eat all that…

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.470
or I won't be satisfied.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:42.540
Really… do you know how much I worried about you?

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.100
Kazune-kun, you idiot!

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.180
From now on…

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.180
there will be lots of tough times, but…

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:57.100
if it's you… I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:59.330
Kazune-kun.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.020
Trust me…

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:02.330
I'll be waiting for you.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.040
Hey you, get away from Karin!

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.490
K-K-Kazune-kun!

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:13.820
Kazune-kun has a twin?

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.070
I told you to get away from her!

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.680
Let's go, Suzune.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.340
I'll see you soon, Karin.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:44.870
What… a dream?

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.650
There was another me…

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:50.460
he wasn't fake, nor was it an act…

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.150
Kazune-kun!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:56.620
Kazune-kun, you woke up…

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.660
Thank goodness!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:01.040
Really, thank goodness!

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.640
Sorry for worrying you.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.900
Sorry!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.540
I had a weird dream…

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.250
Ah, me too.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.970
There were two Kazune-kun's.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:15.130
Huh?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.180
I'm glad it was just a dream.

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:20.700
I wouldn't be able to handle it if there were two of you.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:24.200
What type of dream did you have?

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.860
Karin, in the dream you saw…

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.990
were you at the festival?

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:36.240
Bingo! Correct answer-

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.320
Wait, why do you know about it?

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:41.030
Because that's the same dream I had.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:47.290
Hmmm… Then you should do what you did in the dream, and have a good time today.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.250
Huh?

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.920
The festival's today!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:55.670
We were saying earlier "when Kazune-kun wakes up, 
let's all go to the festival together".

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:59.990
Oh, I know… I should go tell everyone that you're awake.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.950
The festival… huh?

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:11.730
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:15.270
I am God!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:20.230
You moron.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:20.230
It's a croquette! 

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:26.910
Kazune-chan! Thank goodness!

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:30.600
Kazune-kun has been revived!

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:34.130
Thank goodness!

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:37.380
Himeka, you too, do you feel okay?

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:44.390
Yeah, you know, I feel much better!

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:47.810
It might be because I broke Karasuma's ring…

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:51.020
What do you mean, Kazune-kun?

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:53.440
Because I broke their ring,…

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:56.530
the balance tips in our favor.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.410
Everything has become more favorable for us.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:03.780
My ring's power has become stronger since then, too.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:05.790
Is it because of that, too?

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:12.130
The Karasuma's can probably sense your ring's power.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.140
Be careful, Nishikiyori.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.260
Everything is alright!

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.520
I'm here too!

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:22.510
But, lately you haven't done anything.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.810
T-That really hurt.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:30.230
Kazune-chan, you really look much better!

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:33.520
Think you can go to the festival?

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.440
S-Sure.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:40.200
Then, I'll go prepare my yukata!

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.240
Karin-chan, too.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.700
Have you a yukata for me, too? I'm happy.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:51.540
Yay! Yay! A festival… delicious-

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:54.790
How long was I sleeping for?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.630
Sixteen days, Kazune-kun.

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.050
That long?!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.060
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:11.020
Wow! You two look great.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.410
Thanks!

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:17.020
What do you think, Kazune-chan?

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:19.190
Yeah, it looks good.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.840
And Karin is cute too…

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.550
your yukata that is.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.260
What did you say?!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.120
You have to stay here.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:36.380
I want to go to the festival!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.470
We have to watch the house now, don't we?

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:44.360
Kazune-chan, look, look!

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.720
That mask is cute!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.970
It looks like a grasshopper.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.580
That's a bad hobby, Himeka.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:58.440
Why don't you try the grasshopper mask on?

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.820
No-

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:04.570
I'm glad Kazune-kun feels better.

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.910
Hanazono-san!

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.410
Micchi!

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:09.950
Is this alright?

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:13.430
Kazune-kun and Himeka-san went off by themselves.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.420
If I ask for any more than this,…

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.600
God will get mad at me for being selfish.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:23.570
Then, let's go together.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.930
Ah, fried corn!

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:31.030
You want some too, right, Hanazono-san?

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:32.990
I'll go buy some.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.530
Thanks, Micchi!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.980
Nishikiyori Michiru.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:42.420
If I could borrow his power for Himeka…

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.310
Are you alright, Himeka?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.290
We told you not to push yourself.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:56.620
Damn! This is all Kujyou's fault!

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.830
How dare he break my ring!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.210
A brother who can't transform…

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.650
is just a normal student council president.

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:07.090
Just a normal…

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:09.090
student council president?

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:10.100
Sorry!

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.010
I was just joking, nii-san!

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:14.180
Student council president's are amazing, too.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.980
They can do a lot of stuff.

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:19.160
Just watch me, darned Kujyou!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.050
Smells good.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:27.570
If I want Michiru's power…

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:29.620
I need to get him on our side.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.840
Then…

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:38.270
I'll show them that I'm not just a normal student council president!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.750
Umm… Who are you?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.420
I'm not "takoyaki glasses guy"!

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.070
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.280
I got separated from Micchi…

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:59.300
That's…

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.730
I see…

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:07.280
If our Himeka-chan becomes healthy, the other Himeka-chan…

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:11.670
Isn't there a way to save both of them?

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.450
Karin!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.500
Kazune-kun! Is everything alright?

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.620
I got separated from Himeka.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:21.750
Eh?

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.380
She kept wandering around everywhere…

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.630
No good!

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.130
You have to hurry and find her!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.840
She's probably worried about you.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.180
By the way, where's Nishikiyori?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:34.560
I got separated from Micchi too…

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.560
What, so we're the same…

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.990
Good timing, let's search for them together.

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:41.290
Come, let's go.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.120
A shooting game!

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:56.450
Karin, let's stop here a minute.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.080
But Himeka-chan…

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.210
It's just for a little while.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.750
I kinda like that game, since I'm good at it.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:07.650
Kazune-kun, you're like a kid.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.800
Karin, is there anything you want?

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:15.950
Nothing, rather than that, we should-

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.310
That rabbit key chain…

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:24.060
it kind of looks like Kazune-kun when he's irritated.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:27.440
Oh? That ugly doll?

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.530
Well, leave it to me.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.570
But…

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.840
Be quiet for a second.

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.450
Alright!

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:38.410
Amazing!

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:41.750
Here you go, I'll give you a second one.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:42.870
Okay…

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:46.120
This one kinda looks like you.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.480
There's one for each of us.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:16:59.860
How pretty.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:02.990
Karin…

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.820
How much longer will we be able to stay like this?

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:10.730
Kazune-kun?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.240
Ah sorry, for saying something weird.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.490
It's fine!

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.910
We'll always, always be able to be together!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.530
Himeka-chan and Micchi too.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.660
We'll always be together!

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.790
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.640
I'm going go buy something to drink.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.130
Mama!

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:34.130
Suzune-kun?

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.480
Why?..

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.080
This is?..

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:46.200
There's important stuff in there.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:50.000
Let the light guide you.

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:54.960
We'll definitely meet again.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.890
It's to protect you.

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:08.060
I have faith…

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.810
that even when we're far apart…

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:16.570
I will definitely not forget you.

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.950
This memory… I saw it before too…

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:32.210
What does this mean?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:44.450
Why didn't you tell her?

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:48.120
That we're here from the future to save Mama…

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.890
Let's go home, Suzune.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.390
And then he gave you this book?

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.450
Yeah, he gave it to me…

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:14.320
This is the same book my dad had.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.530
Why did he have this?

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:19.670
How should I know?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.010
W-What?

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:38.440
This is…

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:46.660
What does it say?

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:51.400
The light of the moon is reflected from the sun…

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:54.110
The light is disappeared…

00:19:54.110 --> 00:20:02.410
Jupiter is preventing the light from reaching the moon and the two halves cannot reunite.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:07.330
Huh? What's that? Put it in simpler terms.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:10.650
Ah, I have a headache.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.000
I can't tell exactly but…

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.000
Jupiter… and the two halves…

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.970
Must be about the two Himekas.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.430
The light of the moon is reflected from the sun…

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.860
The light is disappeared…

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:31.980
The light is from the sun, in other words, the Sun God…

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:35.770
and our power to protect them is dependent on our rings…

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:38.150
Without those, the Himekas will both disappear.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:41.110
Eh? You're a genius, Kazune-kun.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.700
What does the rest say?

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:45.120
That's all I can understand.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.830
I see…

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:56.170
Jupiter is preventing the light from reaching the moon and the two halves cannot reunite.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.500
We should try researching a little more.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:00.970
We can't understand more than that…

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:02.940
how annoying.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:10.430
This is definitely my dad's signature…

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.480
If this is my dad's book,…

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.690
we should be close to the solution.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:18.890
Somehow… I wish we had a hint of how to save Himeka-chan.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.130
Yeah.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:26.700
Hey! Kazune-kun! Hanazono-san!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.450
Micchi and Himeka-chan.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:31.160
You were in this kind of place?

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.160
We looked all over for you two!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.330
Ah, sorry, sorry.

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:38.090
Thank goodness, we met up.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.760
I met Himeka-san by coincidence…

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:43.880
and we went around the festival together!

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.930
Nishikiyori, your yukata is loose.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:50.430
Ah, maybe I enjoyed myself too much!

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:53.140
Japanese festivals are the best!

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:55.700
Is that so? I'm glad.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:00.920
Nishikiyori Michiru's with Kujyou…

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:03.690
I'll show them what I can do.

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:04.840
Let's go!

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:09.660
A helicopter?

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.930
"Please marry me!", huh?

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:16.710
Karin!

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:18.670
Karin-chan!

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:20.500
Hanazono-san!

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:21.770
Karin!

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.070
A Visit to Karasuma's House
